flowchart TB
    N1["1. neo-zkvm-examples: Proof/evidence flow shows how a claim becomes checkable."]
    N2["2. Claim: This unit performed: Demonstrate APIs | Exercise edge cases | Document expected outputs."]
    N3["3. Witness or input: sample script | example input | local prover"]
    N4["4. Execution or check: replay deterministic computation inside the proof system"]
    N5["5. Public commitment: state root, public values, verification key, and proof digest"]
    N6["6. Verifier: zkVM users | L2 prover service | L1 verification adapter"]
    N7["7. Accepted result: example proof | tutorial output | regression sample"]
    N8["8. Rejected result: reject proof, public output, or mode; state root does not advance"]
    N1 --> N2
    N2 --> N3
    N3 --> N4
    N4 --> N5
    N5 --> N6
    N6 --> N7
    N7 --> N8
